{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33169","headline":"蚕女 · 司马扎","name":"蚕女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养蚕先养桑，蚕老人亦衰。\n苟无园中叶，安得机上丝。\n妾家非豪门，官赋日相追。\n鸣梭夜达晓，犹恐不及时。\n但忧蚕与桑，敢问结发期。\n东邻女新嫁，照镜弄蛾眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}